+  .lp-help { margin-top: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); }
+
+  /* ---- right column ----
+     Same construction as the dashboard's "Continue your case" hero: a
+     .card surface with a radial wash of the accent laid over it from
+     the top-right corner, and the brain mark as quiet decoration. The
+     hero keeps its wash at .07 because it sits among other cards; this
